Apple's <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/iphone-duo/">iPhone Duo</a> has attracted more pre-orders than the company anticipated in several major markets, according to <a href="https://www.digitimes.com/news/a20261023PD215/apple-iphone-macbook-tddi-adoption.html"><em>DigiTimes</em></a>, with display chip suppliers hoping its <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/10/16/apple-iphone-duo-demand-extraordinary/">reception</a> will boost investment in foldable devices.<br/>
<br/>
