<br/>
According to the sources, cost remains an obstacle to introducing &zwnj;OLED&zwnj; TDDI technology in traditional flagship smartphones this year. It is considered to be a technical requirement for foldables, however, giving chipmakers a route to increased shipments even if adoption elsewhere remains limited.<br/>
<br/>
